  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Flower Crown.png|left|200px|Flower crown]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 86\n |price = 1 to 331\n |time = 2 h\n |source = {{Infoicon|hatm|bigger|link=Hat Maker}}\n |xp = 40\n |base = 92\n |dia = 5\n |time3 = 1 h 42 min\n}}\n'''Flower crowns''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 86.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making flower crowns'''===\n[[File:Hat Maker.png|150px|left|Hat Maker]]\nFlower crowns are made in the [[Hat Maker]].\n\nTo make a crown, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Peony.png|75px|Peonies|link=Peony]]\n|[[File:Cotton.png|75px|Cotton|link=Cotton]]\n|-\n|'''x5'''\n|'''x4'''\n|}\nIt takes 2 hours to make a flower crown, and 1 hour and 42 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] maker. Each crown gives players 40 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling flower crowns'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Flower crowns can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 3312 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 units.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a flower crown costs 292 {{Infoicon|Coin}} coins.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders require 1 to 2 flower crowns per crate, a total of up to 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Blumenkrone\n|es = Corona de flores\n|fr = Couronne de Fleurs\n|it = Corona di fiori\n|nl = Bloemenkroon\n|no = Blomsterkrone\n}}\n[[pt-br:Coroa de flores]]\n\n[[Category:Hat Maker Products]]\n[[Category:Cotton Products]]\n[[Category:Peony Products]]",
